<title>USA: UN Sec Council firm on June 8 Iraq oil sales start.</title>
<headline>UN Sec Council firm on June 8 Iraq oil sales start.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Nations Security Council late last week ruled out moving forward the start date for Iraqi oil sales under the second round of their &quot;oil-for-food&quot; deal, a senior U.N. official said Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Security Council agreed on Thursday that the date for oil sales starting is when the Council approved Resolution 1111 (the oil deal second round)...June 8,&quot; said the senior official, who didn't want to be quoted by name.</p>
</text>
